  m_text: "Day 4. Still no one has noticed that I\u2019m not actually a guard. I
    just found the helmet.\n\nThings I\u2019ve learned so far:\n1. If you stand near
    the gate and nod seriously, people leave you alone.\n2. The captain asked me
    for \u201Cthe report.\u201D I handed him a sandwich. He seemed satisfied.\n3.
    Someone keeps stealing my sandwiches. I suspect Greg. There is no Greg. I made
    him up. I\u2019m suspicious of him anyway.\n\nDay 5 plan: Get promoted. Or find
    a different helmet. Whichever comes first."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
